  "title": "ieee1905: Update 1905 Media Types and Frequency Bands",
  "description": "Update Media Types according to IEEE1905 and Easymesh standard\n\nCorrect 11AX and add 11BE\nNote: from 11AX, no distinction is made anymore between the bands (2G,5G,6G)\n\n- IEEE1905 chapter 6.4.7, table 6-12\n- Wi-Fi EasyMesh Specification Version 6.0 chapter 6, table 14\n\n![media_type](/uploads/fbdf8e83dd20b9dc83587ede6c6bf7e8/media_type.png)\n\nUpdate Frequency Bands according to Easymesh standard\n- Wi-Fi EasyMesh Specification Version 6.0 chapter 6, table 15\n\n![freq_band](/uploads/96999999b7d4fd25cfaf68f7a0b760ca/freq_band.png)",
